A Feature Envy smell, refactored with Move Method.

```text
// SMELL: Invoice envies Customer's data
class Invoice:
    method summary(customer):
        return customer.name + " owes " +
               customer.balance + customer.pendingFees

// REFACTOR: move the logic to where the data lives
class Customer:
    method totalOwed():
        return this.balance + this.pendingFees

    method summaryLine():
        return this.name + " owes " + this.totalOwed()

class Invoice:
    method summary(customer):
        return customer.summaryLine()
```

`Invoice` no longer reaches into `Customer`'s internals — it asks for a result instead.
